WEBVTT

00:05:59.897 --> 00:06:04.860
who lit my path with their
unbelievable strength to carry on.

00:06:05.403 --> 00:06:07.905
And then something miraculous happened.

00:06:07.905 --> 00:06:09.990
I met this woman named Jai Bharathi.

00:06:10.825 --> 00:06:14.412
On her motorcycle, she arrived
in the same village I was in,

00:06:14.453 --> 00:06:19.417
and she was there at a training camp,
teaching other women how to ride scooters.

00:06:19.458 --> 00:06:22.211
I had never seen
anything like this before.

00:06:22.253 --> 00:06:26.257
She donned the narrative
of being fierce, the odd one out,

00:06:26.298 --> 00:06:30.678
smashing patriarchy every single time
she rode her motorcycle.